  {
   "id": "note-layer",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -560,
   "y": -584,
   "width": 500,
   "height": 250,
   "text": "**Inside every layer** (pre-norm residual):  \nx += o_proj(GQA(RMSNorm(x)))  \nx += FFN(RMSNorm(x))\n\nAttention ≈ **88.1M** / layer (q, o 6144×6144; k, v 1024×6144).  \nDense FFN ≈ **302.0M** / layer.  \nMoE ≈ **6.37B** / layer stored, 297.3M active (192 experts × 33.0M, + shared)."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-router",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -560,
   "y": -314,
   "width": 500,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "**Router** (`mlp.gate`, has a bias):  \nscore = sigmoid(W·x) over 192 experts;  \ntop-8 picked by score **+ bias** (bias steers selection only);  \nweights = picked scores, normalised to sum 1, × 2.5.  \nShared expert (1 × 1792) runs on every token."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-kv",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240,
   "y": -584,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 210,
   "text": "**KV cache**: K and V for 8 heads × 128 per layer = 2,048 values / token / layer.  \nAll 61 layers, BF16: **244 KiB per token** → 131 GB for one 512K-token context.  \nRoPE θ = 1e+07, only on 64 of 128 head dims; the other 64 carry no position."
  },
  {
   "id": "xo10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 804,
   "y": 700,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1316,
   "y": 690,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 6144]  after L60`"
  },
  {
   "id": "fn12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 749,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**final RMSNorm** (`model.norm`)",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "xf13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 804,
   "y": 845,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1316,
   "y": 835,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 6144]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "head15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 894,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**lm_head** — 6144 → 250624  \n1.54B · untied",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "logits16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 150,
   "y": 990,
   "width": 1800,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1970,
   "y": 980,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`logits [T, 250624]` — bar clipped (real 20050px)"
  },
  {
   "id": "samp18",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 1039,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**softmax → sample**",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "next19",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 1135,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**next token id**",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-src",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1330,
   "y": 1065,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**Sources**: config.json + modeling_k2_horizon.py + safetensors headers of IFM/K2-Horizon-375B-A23B (34,076 tensors, all BF16). No MTP / draft head and no vision tower in the checkpoint. Parameter counts are computed from tensor shapes, not taken from the model card."
  }
 ],
